{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 17,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Pride Promotes Strife"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Where do "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "battles"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "wars and fights "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "come"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from among you? Do "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "they"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "come"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from your "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "desires for"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " pleasure that war in your members? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You lust and do not have. You murder and covet and cannot obtain. You fight and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "battle"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "war. "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit Yet"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet you do not have because you do not ask. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You ask and do not receive, because you ask amiss, that you may spend "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " on your pleasures. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits Adulterers and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Adulterers and adulteresses! Do you not know that friendship with the world is enmity with God? Whoever therefore wants to be a friend of the world makes himself an enemy of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or do you think that the Scripture says in vain, “The Spirit who dwells in us yearns jealously”?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But He gives more grace. Therefore He says:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“God resists the proud,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "But gives grace to the humble.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Humility Cures Worldliness"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore submit to God. Resist the devil and he will flee from you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Draw near to God and He will draw near to you. Cleanse "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hands, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " sinners; and purify "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " hearts, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " double-minded. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Lament and mourn and weep! Let your laughter be turned to mourning and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " joy to gloom. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Humble yourselves in the sight of the Lord, and He will lift you up."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Do Not Judge a Brother"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do not speak evil of one another, brethren. He who speaks evil of a brother and judges his brother, speaks evil of the law and judges the law. But if you judge the law, you are not a doer of the law but a judge. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There is one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU adds and Judge"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Lawgiver, who is able to save and to destroy. Who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M But who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " are you to judge "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU a neighbor"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "another?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Do Not Boast About Tomorrow"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Come now, you who say, “Today or tomorrow "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "M let us"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "we will go to such and such a city, spend a year there, buy and sell, and make a profit”; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "whereas you do not know what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "will happen"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " tomorrow. For what "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " your life? It is even a vapor that appears for a little time and then vanishes away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Instead you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "ought"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to say, “If the Lord wills, we shall live and do this or that.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But now you boast in your arrogance. All such boasting is evil."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, to him who knows to do good and does not do "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to him it is sin."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}